{
  "job_B3.4.10_20251003_114730": {
    "text": "Incipit narrare miracula que facta fuerant ante aduentum Saluatoris domini nostri Iesu Christi.\nHer saga\u00f0 ymb \u00f0as m\u00e6ran gewyrd \u00fee to \u00feyssum d\u00e6ge gewear\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6tte \u00e6lmihtig dryhten sylfa \u00feas world\n& to \u00feyssum d\u00e6ge, \u00fee d\u00e6g is \u00e6lmihtiges dryhtnes gebyrdtid, ealne \u00feysne middangeard mid niwan leohte\nAnd be \u00feysse gewyrde, \u00fee we tod\u00e6g weor\u00f0ia\u00f0, fram worulde fruman ealle Godes halige s\u00e6don hie \u00fe\u00e6t\n& \u00feeah \u00f0e hit ealle s\u00e6don & bodedon, hw\u00e6\u00f0re an Godes \u00fe\u00e6ra halgena \u00fe\u00e6t eallra swiotelecost gesang be\nUtan we blissian & gefeon on him.\nFor \u00f0an \u00f0e on \u00feyssum d\u00e6ge ealra cyninga cyning & ealra wealdendra waldend \u00feysne middangeard for\nMitte \u00fee hit \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6re eadegan tide neal\u00e6hte \u00fe\u00e6tte dryhten lichomlice wolde wesan geboren, swi\u00f0e\n\u00c6rest geeode to \u00feam ge \u00fee he on geboren w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6nige men mid w\u00e6pnum gefeohtan ne meahton,\nSwylce \u00fe\u00e6t eac geeode \u00fe\u00e6tte siofon nihtum \u00e6r Crist geboren w\u00e6re, \u00fe\u00e6t sio sunne \u00e6t midre nihte ongan\n\u00de\u00e6t tacnode \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feas eor\u00f0lican sunnan nihtes scinende him to gisle beforan sende.\nSwylce \u00fe\u00e6t eac geeode unmanegum nihtum \u00e6r Crist geboren w\u00e6s, onsprungon \u00fery wyllas, & of \u00feara\nSwylce manega o\u00f0eru wundor \u00f0\u00e6r w\u00e6ron gewordene \u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6re tide \u00fee he on geboren w\u00e6s, \u00f0a nu unea\u00f0e\n\u00d0a \u00fe\u00e6t geeode \u00fey sylfan d\u00e6ge \u00fee gyrsand\u00e6g w\u00e6s, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e dryhten on niht geboren w\u00e6s \u00e6r\nMitte \u00fee hit \u00fea w\u00e6s sio \u00feridde tid \u00fe\u00e6s d\u00e6ges \u00fe\u00e6 gyrsand\u00e6g w\u00e6s, he \u00f0a beseah on \u00fea lyft ongean \u00fea\nMitte \u00f0e Agustus se casere \u00fe\u00e6t geseah, he cigde ofer eall \u00fe\u00e6t werud, & cw\u00e6\u00f0: \u00de\u00e6t is gesyne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feis is\nFor \u00f0am he fram fruman middangeardes s\u00e6d w\u00e6s, on o\u00f0rum wundrum \u00fea ymb his gebyrd acweden\nUs \u00f0onne nu gedafena\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we weor\u00f0ien \u00feone wuldorf\u00e6stan cyning se us his tacn swa swiotolice\n& \u00fea hra\u00f0e he abead \u00fe\u00e6t sended w\u00e6re to stowa gehwylcre \u00feara \u00fee to his rice belumpe, & abeodan het\n& \u00fea to \u00fe\u00e6re sylfan niht \u00e6r morgensteorra upeode, dryhten w\u00e6s geboren on \u00f0ysne middangeard, &\nMitte \u00f0e Herodes se cyning geascode \u00fe\u00e6t Crist w\u00e6s geboren on Bethlem, Iudea byrig, he hine het secan\nAne d\u00e6ge \u00e6r \u00fean \u00fee he Erodes se cyning hete \u00fea cild cwellan, dryhtnes engel \u00e6tywde Iosepe on\nIosep \u00fea dyde swa him beboden w\u00e6s.\n& mitte \u00fee hy ferdon, hy cwomon to sumum scrafe, & hie woldon restan on him.\nMaria \u00fea astag of \u00f0am nytene, h\u00e6bbende h\u00e6lend \u00fe\u00e6t cild on hire f\u00e6\u00f0me.\n\u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6ron \u00fery cnihtas mid Iosepe & mid Marian \u00fe\u00e6re f\u00e6mnan samod si\u00f0iende.\nSemninga \u00fea uteodon of \u00f0am scrafe manige dracan, \u00fe\u00e6t mitte \u00f0e denum hy locedon on Egypta dune, &\n& mytte \u00fee hie comon to \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre, hie n\u00e6nigne cu\u00f0ne n\u00e6fdon mid hwam hie wunian meahton.\nHy becyrdon to \u00feara goda temple, & mitte \u00fee hio ineode, Maria h\u00e6bbende h\u00e6lend \u00fe\u00e6t cild on hyre\n\u00d0\u00e6t mitte w\u00e6s s\u00e6d Afradisio \u00feam heretogan.\nHe \u00fe\u00e6der cwom mid ealle his werode, & he w\u00e6s ingangende on \u00fe\u00e6t templ, & he geseah eal \u00fea\nHe eode to Marian \u00fe\u00e6re f\u00e6mnan, & he geb\u00e6d h\u00e6lend \u00fe\u00e6t cild, & he spr\u00e6c to eallum his werode, &\n& for \u00fean us is \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we don swa ura god, \u00fey l\u00e6s his yrre & dea\u00f0es frecnes ofer us cume.\n\u00c6fter \u00fean \u00f0a dryhtnes engel \u00e6teowde Iosepe & Marian, & him to cw\u00e6\u00f0: Hwyrfa\u00f0 eft to Iudea lande.\nEalle syndon deade \u00fea \u00fee sohton \u00fe\u00e6ne cniht to acwellanne.\nH\u00e6lend \u00fea weox, & he w\u00e6s gestrangod gaste, & m\u00e6gene & snytero he w\u00e6s gefylled mid Gode & mid\nHim anum is wuldor & weor\u00f0mynd on worulda woruld.\nHw\u00e6t, we nu gehyrdon secgan hwylcnehwegu d\u00e6l ymb usses dryhtnes gebyrd, swylce eac ymb \u00fea wun\nUtan we nu eorne tilian \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00fee selran syn \u00feonne we \u00feylleca bysena usses dryhtnes beforan us reccan\nUtan we healdan sybbe & lufan betwiohs us, \u00feonne gylde\u00f0 us God ece mede \u00e6t ussum ende.",
